          },
          "description": "Join the fun as Grandpop, grandson Beckett and Milo, the family dog, encounter a big-toothed, mischief-maker with a talent for getting into big handfuls of fun-filled trouble.\n\nThe story is designed to expand a child’s natural imagination and tickle everyone’s funny bone as they listen and read the tale of a cute invisible creature living in a big bag with the words “Organic Popcorn - A Surprise in Every Bag!” boldly printed on the outside for all to see.\n\nThe “What-Do-You-Think-Happens-Next Story Generator” at the end of the audio and companion book (supplied as a PDF file) provides hours of additional creative play, drawing activities, and imaginative story creation for children, parents, and teachers. \n\nAfter listening to the story, one thing is certain - Eating popcorn will never be the same again!",
